<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index rose one point to 1,293.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index rose one point to 1,293.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates rose to 1,293 today from 1,292 on Aug 18, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1324    12.019	  1336    12.125</p>
<p>   1a   1241  9400.000	  1248  9450.000</p>
